## 워크플로우 문법 및 구조

### 📝 기본 YAML 구조

```yaml
name: 워크플로우 이름

on: [이벤트]

jobs:
  job-name:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: 단계 이름
        run: 명령어
```

### 🎯 주요 키워드 상세 설명

#### 1. **name**
```yaml
name: CI/CD Pipeline
```

#### 2. **on (트리거 이벤트)**

##### 기본 이벤트
```yaml
on: push                    # 모든 푸시
on: pull_request           # 모든 PR
on: [push, pull_request]   # 여러 이벤트
```

##### 브랜치/경로 필터링
```yaml
on:
  push:
    branches: [main, develop]
    paths: ['src/**', 'tests/**']
  pull_request:
    branches: [main]
```

##### 스케줄 (Cron)
```yaml
on:
  schedule:
    - cron: '0 2 * * *'  # 매일 오전 2시
```

##### 수동 실행
```yaml
on:
  workflow_dispatch:
    inputs:
      environment:
        description: '배포 환경'
        required: true
        default: 'staging'
```

#### 3. **jobs**

##### 기본 Job 구조
```yaml
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Checkout code
        uses: actions/checkout@v3
```

##### 병렬 실행
```yaml
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [...]
  
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [...]
```

##### 순차 실행 (의존성)
```yaml
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [...]
  
  deploy:
    needs: test
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [...]
```

#### 4. **runs-on (실행 환경)**

```yaml
runs-on: ubuntu-latest      # Ubuntu 22.04
runs-on: ubuntu-20.04       # Ubuntu 20.04
runs-on: windows-latest     # Windows Server 2022
runs-on: macos-latest       # macOS 12
runs-on: macos-11           # macOS 11

# 매트릭스 (여러 환경)
strategy:
  matrix:
    os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest]
    node-version: [16, 18, 20]
runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}
```

#### 5. **steps**

##### 기본 Step
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Install dependencies
    run: npm install
```

##### Action 사용
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Checkout code
    uses: actions/checkout@v3
  
  - name: Setup Node.js
    uses: actions/setup-node@v3
    with:
      node-version: '18'
```

##### 조건부 실행
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Deploy to staging
    if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/develop'
    run: echo "Deploying to staging"
  
  - name: Deploy to production
    if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'
    run: echo "Deploying to production"
```

#### 6. **환경 변수 및 시크릿**

##### 환경 변수
```yaml
env:
  NODE_ENV: production
  API_URL: https://api.example.com

jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Use environment variable
        run: echo $NODE_ENV
```

##### 시크릿
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Deploy
    run: echo "Deploying..."
    env:
      API_KEY: ${{ secrets.API_KEY }}
      DATABASE_URL: ${{ secrets.DATABASE_URL }}
```

#### 7. **아티팩트 및 캐시**

##### 아티팩트 업로드
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Build
    run: npm run build
  
  - name: Upload build artifacts
    uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
    with:
      name: build-files
      path: dist/
```

##### 캐시 사용
```yaml
steps:
  - name: Cache node modules
    uses: actions/cache@v3
    with:
      path: ~/.npm
      key: ${{ runner.os }}-node-${{ hashFiles('**/package-lock.json') }}
```

